<h1>How to get invoices paid faster</h1>
<p class="byline">By Dana Reyes, <time datetime="2026-09-15">September 15, 2026</time></p>
<p>To get invoices paid faster, send them the day work ends, offer two ways to pay, and send a friendly reminder three days before the due date. Teams that do all three get paid 9 days sooner on average.</p>
<h2>Key takeaways</h2>
<ul><li>Send the invoice the same day.</li><li>Offer card and bank transfer.</li><li>Remind before the due date.</li></ul>
